1
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,240
=Episode 16=

2
00:00:17,961 --> 00:00:20,247
(Ferrying Souls Across Oblivion)

3
00:00:20,971 --> 00:00:21,847
(Six Steps)

4
00:00:22,495 --> 00:00:24,514
(Forget Your Past)

5
00:00:25,809 --> 00:00:26,837
Forget my past?

6
00:00:28,284 --> 00:00:28,780
No.

7
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,999
I can't forget Eryue.

8
00:00:30,608 --> 00:00:32,019
(Cross the River of Oblivion)

9
00:00:32,019 --> 00:00:33,923
(Be Cast into Unending Hell)

10
00:00:34,533 --> 00:00:36,095
(Never to Be Reincarnated)

11
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:36,627
Let go of me!

12
00:00:37,085 --> 00:00:38,000
I can't forget Eryue.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,027
Let go of me!

14
00:00:44,895 --> 00:00:45,427
Eryue.

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,027
Why are you here?

16
00:00:47,219 --> 00:00:48,095
Were you waiting for me?

17
00:00:48,476 --> 00:00:49,085
How dare you!

18
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:52,094
Eryue.

19
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:53,923
Why are you doing this to me?

20
00:00:56,284 --> 00:00:57,884
Weren't we once in love?

21
00:00:58,038 --> 00:00:58,494
Silence!

22
00:01:01,466 --> 00:01:02,723
Deities and mortals belong
to different worlds.

23
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:04,628
How could a deity

24
00:01:05,657 --> 00:01:07,142
long for a mortal?

25
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,190
A deity?

26
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,447
That's impossible.

27
00:01:21,656 --> 00:01:22,951
My true name is Yellow Dragon.

28
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:24,704
I am the Deity of Zhongtu.

29
00:01:27,446 --> 00:01:28,589
Everything you have

30
00:01:29,618 --> 00:01:30,913
was a gift from me.

31
00:01:31,295 --> 00:01:32,627
And yet you're still not satisfied.

32
00:01:36,514 --> 00:01:37,809
So all of this

33
00:01:39,333 --> 00:01:40,933
was part of your plan.

34
00:01:42,571 --> 00:01:44,399
Were your feelings for me fake too?

35
00:01:45,008 --> 00:01:45,541
Yes.

36
00:01:47,637 --> 00:01:49,694
My heart belongs to all living beings.

37
00:01:51,065 --> 00:01:52,514
I could never devote it to just one.

38
00:01:54,113 --> 00:01:55,104
So I advise you to stop

39
00:01:55,714 --> 00:01:56,933
clinging to this hopeless obsession.

40
00:01:58,571 --> 00:01:59,447
Cross the river now.

41
00:02:00,666 --> 00:02:01,313
Move on to your next life.

42
00:02:11,828 --> 00:02:12,780
I understand.

43
00:02:14,152 --> 00:02:15,600
Since you don't love me,

44
00:02:16,399 --> 00:02:17,923
why should I keep clinging to you?

45
00:02:22,266 --> 00:02:23,219
I'm leaving.

46
00:02:30,684 --> 00:02:31,523
Yellow Dragon.

47
00:02:32,589 --> 00:02:33,389
Did you know

48
00:02:34,227 --> 00:02:36,476
I've always seen through your lies?

49
00:02:37,999 --> 00:02:39,447
You have your reasons in this life.

50
00:02:39,866 --> 00:02:40,819
I won't force you.

51
00:02:41,846 --> 00:02:42,646
In our next life,

52
00:02:43,904 --> 00:02:45,465
you must come find me.

53
00:02:57,771 --> 00:02:58,532
Liuyue.

54
00:03:01,352 --> 00:03:03,142
I interfered with your fate

55
00:03:03,485 --> 00:03:05,237
and caused your tragic death today.

56
00:03:06,076 --> 00:03:07,180
Forget me.

57
00:03:07,866 --> 00:03:09,580
You still have countless lives ahead.

58
00:03:10,532 --> 00:03:11,370
You can still...

59
00:03:12,628 --> 00:03:14,419
find someone worthy of you again.

60
00:03:27,370 --> 00:03:28,933
Since you love her so much,

61
00:03:29,732 --> 00:03:30,684
I'll make you

62
00:03:31,065 --> 00:03:32,514
watch her suffer

63
00:03:32,514 --> 00:03:33,695
while you can do nothing.

64
00:03:33,695 --> 00:03:34,189
Then,

65
00:03:35,027 --> 00:03:36,627
you'll die in agony.

66
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:39,295
Don't touch her!

67
00:04:12,057 --> 00:04:14,875
Demon-Suppressing Seal.

68
00:04:19,941 --> 00:04:20,551
Break!

69
00:04:35,219 --> 00:04:36,665
(Once the seal is broken,)

70
00:04:36,819 --> 00:04:38,838
(Demonic Energy will enter your body
and turn you into a demon.)

71
00:04:38,838 --> 00:04:40,209
(There will be no turning back.)

72
00:04:42,037 --> 00:04:43,218
Anyone who harms Xi Yuan

73
00:04:44,475 --> 00:04:45,351
dies.

74
00:04:52,322 --> 00:04:52,819
Did you

75
00:04:53,465 --> 00:04:54,152
send her away?

76
00:04:54,989 --> 00:04:55,866
In the end,

77
00:04:56,171 --> 00:04:57,580
just as we intended,

78
00:04:57,808 --> 00:04:59,218
their love remained unfulfilled,

79
00:04:59,713 --> 00:05:01,276
and death tore them apart.

80
00:05:02,114 --> 00:05:03,257
But now,

81
00:05:03,790 --> 00:05:05,427
it all seems unbearably cruel.

82
00:05:11,523 --> 00:05:13,160
But we can't turn back.

83
00:05:14,837 --> 00:05:16,209
We mustn't turn back.

84
00:05:34,837 --> 00:05:36,551
- Such powerful Demonic Energy.
- Such powerful Demonic Energy.

85
00:05:37,580 --> 00:05:39,103
Interesting. Very interesting.

86
00:05:39,371 --> 00:05:40,019
Still,

87
00:05:40,703 --> 00:05:41,618
falling into demonic corruption

88
00:05:41,618 --> 00:05:42,799
must be painful, right?

89
00:05:52,476 --> 00:05:54,418
Spatial Severance.

90
00:05:58,723 --> 00:05:59,827
- Nine Nether Soul Devour!
- Nine Nether Soul Devour!

91
00:05:59,827 --> 00:06:00,703
- Ten Deaths, No Survival!
- Ten Deaths, No Survival!

92
00:06:01,238 --> 00:06:03,066
- Soul-Destroying Formation!
- Soul-Destroying Formation!

93
00:06:10,189 --> 00:06:11,409
Since you used Demonic Energy,

94
00:06:12,247 --> 00:06:13,657
you'll pay the price.

95
00:06:14,646 --> 00:06:15,484
Jin Yunlie.

96
00:06:16,476 --> 00:06:17,542
This Soul-Destroying Formation

97
00:06:17,542 --> 00:06:19,713
was specifically used
against Demon Clan traitors.

98
00:06:21,427 --> 00:06:21,923
Now,

99
00:06:22,952 --> 00:06:24,323
it's perfect for you.

100
00:06:25,465 --> 00:06:26,571
In less than fifteen minutes,

101
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,428
your soul will be obliterated.

102
00:06:40,132 --> 00:06:41,313
Jin Yunlie!

103
00:06:46,152 --> 00:06:46,722
Xi Yuan!

104
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,284
(Is doing this for him)

105
00:06:48,627 --> 00:06:49,619
(really worth it?)

106
00:06:59,713 --> 00:07:00,514
Who would've thought

107
00:07:00,971 --> 00:07:02,265
that after ten million years,

108
00:07:02,799 --> 00:07:04,818
I'd witness a sight like this?

109
00:07:05,733 --> 00:07:06,608
This is

110
00:07:07,409 --> 00:07:09,122
truly satisfying.

111
00:07:09,428 --> 00:07:10,380
You're not Xi Yuan.

112
00:07:11,256 --> 00:07:11,714
You're...

113
00:07:14,875 --> 00:07:15,903
If that's true,

114
00:07:16,970 --> 00:07:17,961
then you must be

115
00:07:19,561 --> 00:07:20,971
Xi Yuan's former incarnation.

116
00:07:30,914 --> 00:07:32,590
You shouldn't have betrayed me.

117
00:07:33,771 --> 00:07:35,142
You've fallen into demonhood,

118
00:07:35,903 --> 00:07:38,190
and my Phoenix Primordial Flame

119
00:07:38,684 --> 00:07:40,475
is the bane of Demonic Energy.

120
00:07:41,313 --> 00:07:42,647
It's time to settle

121
00:07:43,218 --> 00:07:45,122
the score between us.

122
00:07:52,932 --> 00:07:53,503
They're

123
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:55,638
turning on each other.

124
00:07:56,057 --> 00:07:57,503
Isn't that even better?

125
00:07:57,808 --> 00:07:59,103
Once Jin Yunlie is dead,

126
00:07:59,676 --> 00:08:01,427
we can sit back and reap the rewards.

127
00:08:09,275 --> 00:08:10,876
If I truly harmed you,

128
00:08:11,866 --> 00:08:13,009
then kill me.

129
00:08:13,619 --> 00:08:14,722
I won't resent you.

130
00:08:15,446 --> 00:08:16,360
But I need to know.

131
00:08:18,075 --> 00:08:19,638
Will Xi Yuan come back?

132
00:08:20,019 --> 00:08:21,314
You have no right to care about her.

133
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,495
Once you're dead,

134
00:08:22,951 --> 00:08:24,360
she'll come back.

135
00:08:25,808 --> 00:08:26,532
That's good.

136
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:29,276
You must

137
00:08:31,219 --> 00:08:32,400
get her

138
00:08:33,656 --> 00:08:34,608
out of here safely.

139
00:08:35,485 --> 00:08:36,399
It's not him.

140
00:08:37,504 --> 00:08:37,885
No.

141
00:08:38,646 --> 00:08:39,370
Impossible.

142
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:40,818
That face...

143
00:08:41,428 --> 00:08:42,722
I could never mistake it.

144
00:08:43,371 --> 00:08:44,323
Die!

145
00:08:49,542 --> 00:08:50,000
No!

146
00:08:50,570 --> 00:08:51,790
Don't hurt him!

147
00:09:00,247 --> 00:09:00,894
Xi Yuan.

148
00:09:01,542 --> 00:09:02,913
I'm helping you.

149
00:09:02,951 --> 00:09:04,627
Why are you resisting me?

150
00:09:04,627 --> 00:09:05,427
Helping me?

151
00:09:06,342 --> 00:09:07,371
Who are you?

152
00:09:07,638 --> 00:09:09,276
Why do you look exactly like me?

153
00:09:09,276 --> 00:09:10,532
I am you,

154
00:09:10,532 --> 00:09:11,599
and you are me.

155
00:09:11,599 --> 00:09:13,389
Ten thousand years ago,
we were the Phoenix Deity.

156
00:09:13,503 --> 00:09:13,999
We

157
00:09:14,722 --> 00:09:15,789
were betrayed

158
00:09:16,933 --> 00:09:17,922
and killed

159
00:09:18,646 --> 00:09:20,285
by the Huyun Deity.

160
00:09:21,275 --> 00:09:21,999
Today,

161
00:09:22,799 --> 00:09:24,666
I'm avenging us.

162
00:09:25,427 --> 00:09:26,571
The Huyun Deity?

163
00:09:27,941 --> 00:09:28,704
You mean

164
00:09:29,314 --> 00:09:30,152
Jin Yunlie?

165
00:09:32,475 --> 00:09:33,619
How is that possible?

166
00:09:33,619 --> 00:09:34,951
He's just an ordinary man.

167
00:09:34,951 --> 00:09:36,438
He can't be the Huyun Deity.

168
00:09:36,513 --> 00:09:37,733
Jin Yunlie?

169
00:09:38,571 --> 00:09:40,476
Is that his new name?

170
00:09:42,837 --> 00:09:45,009
Even if he changed his appearance

171
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,760
and remade his entire body,

172
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:47,980
I will never forget him.

173
00:09:48,284 --> 00:09:48,933
Fine.

174
00:09:49,846 --> 00:09:51,751
If you've forgotten that memory,

175
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:54,265
I'll help you remember it.

176
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,680
Really?

177
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,960
That's wonderful.

178
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,760
Yes.

179
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:08,920
Except...

180
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,280
you have to die.

181
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:16,720
This...

182
00:10:18,571 --> 00:10:19,865
Is that me with him?

183
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:26,240
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit♪

184
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:29,680
♪The envy of everyone♪

185
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:33,200
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions♪

186
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:36,440
♪Leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

187
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:39,960
♪No matter how long or hard our road♪

188
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,600
♪I don't care♪

189
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:46,680
♪But you left me with this pain♪

190
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:49,240
♪Forever beyond redemption♪
